# Editor testing is Steve's

Do not open the Quake64 editor to check a change. Steve tests it.

- Do not load `editor/index.html` in a browser (`file://` or `http://`).
- Do not start a local server so the editor can be viewed.
- Do not drive the editor with browser tools (navigate, click, snapshot, CDP) to confirm UI.

Edit `editor/js/` and `editor/styles.css`, run `python editor/bundle_editor.py` when the bundle needs updating, and stop. Report what changed. Leave the click-through to him.
